<chapter xml:id="modules" xmlns="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook">
  <title>Module Catalog</title>
  <para>All modules use the Maven group <code>org.apache.opennlp.addons</code>.</para>
  <table xml:id="modules.catalog">
    <title>Add-ons modules</title>
    <tgroup cols="2">
      <thead><row><entry>Artifact</entry><entry>Function</entry></row></thead>
      <tbody>
        <row>
          <entry><code>geoentitylinker</code></entry>
          <entry>Detects and links geographic entities</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
          <entry><code>japanese</code></entry>
          <entry>Adds features for Japanese text processing</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
          <entry><code>liblinear</code></entry>
          <entry>Supplies LIBLINEAR-backed model support</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
          <entry><code>modelbuilder</code></entry>
          <entry>Provides model-building utilities</entry>
        </row>
      </tbody>
    </tgroup>
  </table>
  <para>Depend on the artifact for the selected module. The root <code>opennlp-addons</code> POM coordinates the
        reactor build and is not a combined add-ons JAR.</para>
</chapter>
